ve]\\nA computer system is experiencing performance issues, and the design team is reviewing whether to add more registers, increase cache size, or invest in larger auxiliary storage to balance speed and cost. Compare and contrast the different levels of the memory hierarchy from registers to auxiliary memory, and suggest the level that would offer the best improvement for the system\'s performance issue.","marks":5,"options_json":null,"answer_key":null},{"source_qno":"26","q_number":31,"section_type":"SECTION-C","question_type":"ESSAY","question_text":"Question 26\\nExplain De Morgan\'s Laws with suitable examples and their use in simplifying Boolean expressions.","marks":10,"options_json":null,"answer_key":null},{"source_qno":"27","q_number":32,"section_type":"SECTION-C","question_type":"ESSAY","question_text":"Question 27\\nDifferentiate SR flipflop with JK flipflop with block diagram, truth table with suitable circuit diagram.","marks":10,"options_json":null,"answer_key":null},{"source_qno":"28","q_number":33,"section_type":"SECTION-C","question_type":"ESSAY","question_text":"Question 28\\nExplain the concepts of Input-Output operations and Interrupts in a computer system.","marks":10,"options_json":null,"answer_key":null},{"source_qno":"29","q_number":34,"section_type":"SECTION-C","question_type":"ESSAY","question_text":"Question 29\\nDiscuss the concept of pipelining in computer architecture and the differences between arithmetic pipeline and instruction pipeline.","marks":10,"options_json":null,"answer_key":null},{"source_qno":"30","q_number":35,"section_type":"SECTION-D","question_type":"ESSAY","question_text":"Question 30\\nA computer frequently uses the same instructions, but they run slowly because they are repeatedly fetched from main memory. At the same time, large files stored on disk take longer to access. Evaluate the role of cache memory and virtual memory in a computer that frequently accesses the same instructions and large disk-stored files, considering their impact on overall system performance.","marks":10,"options_json":null,"answer_key":null}]',true);
